WEBVTT

00:25.430 --> 00:26.720
<i>Good to see you, everyone!</i>

00:26.720 --> 00:29.430
<i>Don't forget to
click the follow button, all right?</i>

00:30.430 --> 00:31.700
<i>Lu Guang, say something!</i>

00:33.350 --> 00:35.020
<i>Hi. Follow us.</i>

00:35.020 --> 00:35.430
<i>Hi. Follow us.</i>

00:38.740 --> 00:43.090
Officer Wang, why did you take Cheng
Xiaoshi out of the station? What happened?

00:43.090 --> 00:44.440
Where is he now?

00:44.440 --> 00:45.660
Where are you? I'll come—

00:45.660 --> 00:46.970
Qiao Ling,

00:46.970 --> 00:48.260
calm down.

00:48.260 --> 00:49.450
Do not come get me.

00:49.450 --> 00:50.810
It's too dangerous.

00:50.810 --> 00:52.260
Officer Wang? Officer Wang—

00:52.260 --> 00:54.560
Hey, what's going on?

00:54.560 --> 00:57.600
Sir, did you see which
direction Officer Wang went in?

00:58.300 --> 01:01.210
She just took
those two kids to get dinner.

01:01.210 --> 01:05.650
Then Captain Xiao had me call 
for backup, but what's going on?

01:07.320 --> 01:11.120
<i>Based on what Officer Wang just said,
they should still be nearby.</i>

01:11.120 --> 01:12.200
<i>But where?</i>

01:13.920 --> 01:14.530
<i>Hm?</i>

01:15.270 --> 01:17.170
<i>When did Lu Guang text me?</i>

01:21.730 --> 01:23.300
<i>Where is this...</i>

01:23.540 --> 01:24.730
<i>By the river?</i>

01:31.100 --> 01:32.350
<i>No one is picking up.</i>

01:36.880 --> 01:38.130
H-Hey!

01:38.130 --> 01:39.810
No running!

03:45.680 --> 03:46.870
Cheng Xiaoshi!

03:53.310 --> 03:54.840
Why are you going with her?

03:54.840 --> 03:56.950
I never expected her to catch up first.

03:58.270 --> 04:00.310
It's all for nothing anyway...

04:00.830 --> 04:02.310
since we're going by boat.

04:02.930 --> 04:04.460
Let's see her catch up now.

04:05.880 --> 04:06.970
Cheng Xiaoshi!

04:54.230 --> 04:55.720
It looks like...

04:55.720 --> 04:57.090
I made it in time.

04:58.220 --> 04:59.120
Lu Guang?

04:59.600 --> 05:01.070
Why are you here?

05:10.730 --> 05:12.290
What's happening?

05:12.290 --> 05:13.310
Where am I?

05:14.560 --> 05:15.400
Cheng Xiaoshi!

05:23.610 --> 05:24.680
She's getting away!

05:32.340 --> 05:33.060
Good job!

05:34.680 --> 05:35.240
Huh?

05:37.750 --> 05:38.480
Lu Guang!

05:58.820 --> 06:00.660
Why did Lu Guang go with her?

06:07.810 --> 06:09.610
Captain Xiao! Officer Wang Juan!

06:11.440 --> 06:14.460
Hurry, get her to the hospital...

06:16.800 --> 06:19.130
Captain Xiao! Are you okay?

06:19.130 --> 06:20.090
What happened?

06:22.420 --> 06:23.720
Tell the men

06:24.420 --> 06:29.790
to send out an APB to every single station

06:29.790 --> 06:31.470
to catch Li Tianxi!

06:40.940 --> 06:42.060
How did it go?

06:42.620 --> 06:44.290
I assume you brought him back?

06:47.660 --> 06:48.490
Hm?

06:50.020 --> 06:54.690
Despite the minor setbacks, it looks
like everything went according to plan.

07:19.220 --> 07:21.200
Why would you bring back that one?

07:22.710 --> 07:25.070
He showed up as soon as the boat arrived.

07:25.070 --> 07:27.940
It was an emergency.
I had to let Cheng Xiaoshi go.

07:28.430 --> 07:32.070
I did not even let Xiao Li know
where he would be taking the boat.

07:32.070 --> 07:34.100
How the hell could he have known?

07:41.690 --> 07:45.330
How could someone
just vanish without a trace?

07:46.340 --> 07:47.800
Was anyone else in here?

07:48.070 --> 07:51.870
No, it was just us three.
And the door was locked from the inside.

07:51.870 --> 07:52.520
We thought—

07:55.180 --> 07:56.640
Did you check the cameras?

07:57.140 --> 08:00.110
We did, but we thought Mr. Lu was in danger,

08:00.110 --> 08:03.020
so we only focused on
footage of the broken window.

08:03.020 --> 08:07.180
But actually, he slipped
out of his room only after we'd rushed in.

08:10.630 --> 08:11.720
Captain Xiao!

08:14.200 --> 08:15.440
Any trace of Lu Guang?!

08:15.440 --> 08:16.600
Cheng, calm down.

08:17.360 --> 08:21.630
What we've found so far
means that Lu Guang planned to leave here.

08:21.630 --> 08:24.550
What we haven't found
is how he knew about the boat.

08:25.200 --> 08:25.900
Damn it!

08:26.900 --> 08:30.420
If I hadn't lost control of myself,
he wouldn't be in this mess.

08:30.420 --> 08:35.060
Nothing can come of blaming yourself.
Let's just focus on figuring this out.

08:35.500 --> 08:39.570
It wasn't only you who lost control.
Wang Juan was possessed too.

08:39.570 --> 08:43.520
Regardless, I put out an APB
on both Li Tianxi and Lu Guang.

08:44.470 --> 08:47.890
And I found key info
when I looked through the case file.

08:55.160 --> 08:56.220
Qian Jin?!

08:57.060 --> 08:59.310
Qian Jin was the one
in charge of their case?!

09:00.280 --> 09:02.100
After looking through the file,

09:02.100 --> 09:07.270
I found out that Liu Lan and Li Fan's case
was Qian Jin's last case on the force.

09:19.520 --> 09:21.250
And shortly after the murders,

09:21.250 --> 09:22.350
Qian Jin resigned.

09:23.000 --> 09:27.310
Then, Li Tianxi and Li Tianchen vanished,
along with their case files.

09:28.330 --> 09:31.700
Considering all that,
it's clear Qian Jin is involved.

09:33.220 --> 09:37.930
It also explains why those thugs working for
Liu Jing and him showed up at the hospital.

09:39.030 --> 09:40.600
I'm having him tailed,

09:41.110 --> 09:44.220
but without concrete evidence,
we have to be careful.

09:44.930 --> 09:46.720
We can't show that we're onto him.

09:47.220 --> 09:50.180
First things first, we find out
what happened to Lu Guang.

09:50.890 --> 09:52.220
Is the room untouched?

09:52.680 --> 09:53.600
Yes, sir.

09:53.600 --> 09:57.350
We searched his room,
but we were careful not to disturb it.

10:00.390 --> 10:01.310
The bathroom too?

10:01.810 --> 10:04.020
Oh, we didn't search it yet.

10:06.230 --> 10:09.180
He likely broke the window
to draw your attention,

10:09.180 --> 10:11.220
and then hid in here to slip past you.

10:13.110 --> 10:17.100
From here to the river would
have taken him less than 20 minutes.

10:17.100 --> 10:21.310
But his actions show zero hesitation,
as if he'd planned them in advance.

10:23.650 --> 10:25.220
Oh, right,

10:25.220 --> 10:26.930
Lu Guang texted me the location.

10:26.930 --> 10:28.720
That's how I got there first.

10:34.920 --> 10:36.390
Is this Lu Guang's phone?

10:36.390 --> 10:37.010
Yes.

10:37.010 --> 10:38.220
Yes, that's his.

10:39.200 --> 10:42.310
It's as if he also left clues for us...

10:43.270 --> 10:45.140
Do either of you know his passcode?

10:45.920 --> 10:46.730
I know it.

10:50.970 --> 10:52.480
There. It's unlocked now.

10:52.480 --> 10:55.210
I never thought Lu Guang
would tell you his passcode.

10:55.210 --> 10:57.410
Does 091305 mean something?

10:58.850 --> 11:01.600
No idea. I just
happened to see him put it in.

11:01.600 --> 11:02.560
You...

11:04.770 --> 11:07.470
Qiao Ling, you're the only missed call.

11:07.480 --> 11:08.810
Now his photos...

11:09.900 --> 11:11.240
Huh?

11:11.720 --> 11:15.430
What's this one? Was there
something outside his window?

11:16.440 --> 11:18.450
Wait, it's a photo!

11:20.100 --> 11:21.600
Now that we have a photo,

11:21.600 --> 11:24.310
can't you enter it and find out?

11:24.650 --> 11:25.930
Check the timestamp!

11:27.430 --> 11:30.640
Wait, he also texted me at exactly 6:42 p.m.

11:31.220 --> 11:32.610
Hmm...

11:32.610 --> 11:34.430
Right before we left here earlier,

11:34.430 --> 11:36.520
Lu Guang looked anxious.

11:38.960 --> 11:44.020
And, Cheng, on the way to the station, I'll 
give you some pointers about interrogations.

11:44.020 --> 11:45.020
Okay.

11:45.020 --> 11:49.270
Given his state of mind, I doubt
he would have taken a scenic photo.

11:49.270 --> 11:52.390
Lu Guang must have had
another reason for taking it.

11:52.980 --> 11:56.970
It's possible that he wanted
to take the photo as a time marker.

11:58.270 --> 12:03.240
As long as he took it then, that moment
could become a kind of turning point.

12:04.720 --> 12:07.680
No wonder Lu Guang's
movements seemed off to me!

12:08.180 --> 12:12.140
When Master Si Wen used to train us,
he was never as adept as you were.

12:12.890 --> 12:15.770
That means the one
who fought against Li Tianxi...

12:21.640 --> 12:23.680
the same one who acted without thinking...

12:24.180 --> 12:25.800
was actually you,

12:25.800 --> 12:26.740
Cheng Xiaoshi!

12:29.210 --> 12:34.870
Then, if I don't enter this photo, isn't it
possible things will turn out differently?

12:36.060 --> 12:38.930
Then maybe I would be the one she kidnapped.

12:39.140 --> 12:42.560
Uh... hey, what are you guys talking about?

12:43.060 --> 12:46.220
Oh, it's just some sci-fi story.

12:46.720 --> 12:47.950
Give us the room.

12:47.950 --> 12:48.930
O-Okay.

12:50.390 --> 12:52.020
<i>Lu Guang...</i>

12:52.020 --> 12:55.890
<i>were you planning that whole time
to risk yourself for me?</i>

13:07.200 --> 13:10.530
This guy is bleeding all over the floor.

13:11.570 --> 13:13.250
I cannot have him die here.

13:14.890 --> 13:17.680
We have to find a way
to bring Cheng Xiaoshi here.

13:25.650 --> 13:27.720
If we can get him here,

13:28.220 --> 13:30.320
we'll be able to use his power

13:30.320 --> 13:31.790
to rewrite the past...

13:36.020 --> 13:37.270
Yeah, what is it?

13:38.510 --> 13:39.540
What?!

13:39.540 --> 13:41.690
Really? They found Li Tianxi?!

13:43.520 --> 13:47.430
<i>Yes, sir. The Nande District police
received a report two nights ago.</i>

13:49.170 --> 13:53.520
Whoa, this place is a ghost town now.
I remember how busy it used to be.

13:53.970 --> 13:57.710
Everyone relocated. They're waiting
to demolish the old buildings.

13:59.470 --> 14:00.890
Huh? Hold up.

14:01.470 --> 14:02.770
There's someone inside.

14:03.220 --> 14:04.890
That's not possible.

14:04.890 --> 14:06.100
Come on, let's go.

14:06.100 --> 14:06.970
Nah, listen!

14:07.470 --> 14:09.020
I swear someone's in there!

14:09.220 --> 14:11.210
What if it's a ghost?

14:12.530 --> 14:14.970
What are you, chicken? Let's check it out.

14:14.970 --> 14:16.050
I'm not a chicken!

14:17.980 --> 14:20.060
Quit yapping and help me open this.

14:23.560 --> 14:24.390
What the...

14:26.200 --> 14:27.600
I knew it was open!

14:27.600 --> 14:29.140
Come on, let's look around.

14:29.140 --> 14:30.970
If we can get him here,

14:30.970 --> 14:32.840
we'll be able to use his power

14:32.840 --> 14:34.100
to rewrite the past...

14:35.100 --> 14:35.820
Who's there?!

14:38.940 --> 14:41.350
...including finding your sister.

14:45.520 --> 14:49.010
<i>Two young men found a girl
in an abandoned grocery store.</i>

14:50.020 --> 14:55.560
<i>There was no missing persons report at that
time, but her description matches Li Tianxi.</i>

14:57.740 --> 15:00.850
All right, it shouldn't be long now.

15:01.360 --> 15:03.520
The police will find your sister soon.

15:07.490 --> 15:11.080
As you are well aware,
betrayal is the thing I detest most.

15:12.000 --> 15:13.390
So even if it's her...

15:14.850 --> 15:16.220
I won't show any mercy.

15:19.180 --> 15:21.430
Aren't you forgetting our other options?

15:23.460 --> 15:24.390
Well then,

15:24.890 --> 15:28.400
why don't you enlighten me
as to our final move?

15:53.770 --> 15:54.680
Where is she?!

15:55.320 --> 15:56.310
Captain Xiao!

15:56.310 --> 15:58.470
Li Tianxi, where's Lu Guang?

15:59.960 --> 16:01.560
Still playing dumb?!

15:59.970 --> 16:01.560
Please calm down, sir.

16:01.560 --> 16:05.470
This girl came straight from the
Nande District Station. It can't be her.

16:06.490 --> 16:09.370
I was in here with her earlier. It's her!

16:09.970 --> 16:11.520
Answer me, where's Lu Guang?!

16:17.680 --> 16:18.350
Huh?

16:19.870 --> 16:22.340
Wh-Why are you crying...

16:25.270 --> 16:27.430
That's enough, Cheng Xiaoshi. Calm down.

16:27.430 --> 16:30.310
It's possible she's not
the Li Tianxi we saw earlier.

16:31.600 --> 16:34.210
How would that be possible?
She looks identical!

16:34.860 --> 16:36.180
Does that mean it was...

16:36.740 --> 16:39.810
Sir, this is definitely the real Li Tianxi.

16:39.810 --> 16:41.970
She seems to be not only mute,

16:41.970 --> 16:45.100
but also suffering from
arrested psychological development.

16:59.310 --> 17:02.640
So the girl earlier was really
her brother impersonating her.

17:03.140 --> 17:05.960
But why isn't he more
concerned with his sister?

17:05.960 --> 17:08.230
Why was he so focused on kidnapping you?

17:08.570 --> 17:13.460
It's possible that he's the one
who has been possessing people,

17:13.460 --> 17:16.420
but how did he control
Officer Wang Juan and me together?

17:16.700 --> 17:18.890
And how does he activate his power?

17:20.220 --> 17:22.770
Those answers are in
the photo Lu Guang left.

17:24.580 --> 17:25.140
But—

17:25.140 --> 17:28.100
Even if you avoid entering it,
the past won't change.

17:28.640 --> 17:32.640
If you ask me, what <i>has</i> happened
is inevitably what <i>will</i> happen.

17:33.220 --> 17:37.270
Amongst countless outcomes,
Lu Guang sacrificed himself to save you.

17:37.910 --> 17:39.770
That fate is inevitable.

17:41.730 --> 17:44.950
"The past and future
must not be changed."

17:49.640 --> 17:51.650
Thanks, Qiao Ling.

17:52.970 --> 17:57.390
We've tried many methods, but she
has neither eaten nor communicated with us.

17:58.180 --> 18:01.270
This may go from bad to worse
if we keep pushing her.

18:02.270 --> 18:06.850
It's late now, so why don't we find
a psychologist to talk to her in the morning?

18:07.570 --> 18:11.560
As we speak, there's
a hostage under their control.

18:11.560 --> 18:13.850
Time is of the essence, so we can't let up.

18:13.850 --> 18:16.280
Captain Xiao, may I try to talk to her?

18:21.110 --> 18:22.180
We may as well.

18:23.130 --> 18:26.120
Oh, right, can you also
grab a few things for me?

18:37.280 --> 18:38.970
Hi, my name is Qiao Ling.

18:42.350 --> 18:46.030
They told me you haven't
had dinner, is that true?

18:46.030 --> 18:47.970
So I brought you milk and some snacks.

18:50.520 --> 18:53.120
It's okay. You can drink it
whenever you want.

18:54.650 --> 18:55.770
Wanna hear a story?

18:55.770 --> 18:58.930
When my younger brother
was little, he hated milk.

19:01.240 --> 19:03.210
Here, drink your milk.

19:04.430 --> 19:06.270
Don't wanna. It's gross.

19:06.770 --> 19:10.060
You haven't even tried it,
so how would you know?

19:10.060 --> 19:11.760
Come on, be good and take a sip.

19:11.760 --> 19:12.470
No way!

19:13.440 --> 19:15.850
Drinking milk will make you taller!

19:16.360 --> 19:18.390
You're just lying! I won't drink it!

19:18.390 --> 19:20.680
Cheng Xiaoshi, you're being a dummy!

19:21.460 --> 19:22.970
Qiao Ling, you've changed!

19:23.170 --> 19:25.190
Now you act like a...

19:27.270 --> 19:29.970
Now you act like a girl tiger.

19:31.420 --> 19:33.060
Look at me, I'm a dummy!

19:33.060 --> 19:35.700
My name's Cheng Xiaoshi,
and I'm a big dummy!

19:37.390 --> 19:38.510
Qiao Ling!

19:39.100 --> 19:42.270
That's it, I'm gonna draw a big, paper tiger!

19:40.270 --> 19:42.260
I'm Cheng Xiaoshi the dummy!

19:46.230 --> 19:49.600
After that, he drank
the milk all at once.

19:49.600 --> 19:51.020
I laughed at him so hard.

19:51.520 --> 19:54.350
And the more I laughed,
the faster he drank it.

19:55.640 --> 19:58.640
When he finished it,
he drew all over the carton.

19:59.900 --> 20:05.470
I always saw myself as his big sister,
but we're not that far apart in age.

20:06.410 --> 20:09.290
Now he's all grown up,
and he's tall and strong.

20:10.110 --> 20:14.400
He is still impulsive sometimes,
just like he was when he was a kid.

20:16.100 --> 20:18.470
But when he's up against all odds,

20:19.520 --> 20:21.600
there's no one cooler.

20:37.930 --> 20:39.020
So...

20:39.520 --> 20:43.760
I bet it's because he listened to me
and drank his milk, don't you think so?

20:43.760 --> 20:45.020
How about you?

20:45.350 --> 20:47.330
Will you tell me your story too?

21:13.490 --> 21:14.770
Li Tianchen, right?

21:16.180 --> 21:18.810
I see why Cheng Xiaoshi
keeps you around.

21:18.810 --> 21:20.140
Very clever.

21:21.970 --> 21:23.060
Now then...

21:23.820 --> 21:26.470
how did you know
where and when to find us?

21:27.330 --> 21:30.970
If I tell you, won't
I immediately lose my worth to you?

21:39.330 --> 21:42.220
You annoy the shit out of me.

21:42.220 --> 21:44.310
I regret going easy on you before.

21:45.240 --> 21:49.130
But you know what?
Now I get to make you suffer.

23:19.530 --> 23:22.220
<i>Shit, he's not supposed to check in here!</i>
